{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object found, then approach it, take it, check its properties and do task, otherwise scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaToFindObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReachable    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
